let harness = AgentHarness::builder(agent)
    .session_id("my-session")
    .jsonl_backend()
    .build();
harness.prompt("Hello").await?;
```

Each step is optional. You can stop at any layer, importing only the capabilities you need.

## Summary

Unidirectional layered architecture isn't a silver bullet, but it gives ice several key properties: **lightweight core**, **clear boundaries**, **replaceable components**, and **testable layers**. When building your own Agent, this design lets you start with minimal experiments and gradually grow into your product."
