ice 的解决方案是**抽象环境操作**。

## ExecutionEnv trait

`ExecutionEnv` 定义了所有环境操作的接口：

```rust
pub trait ExecutionEnv: Send + Sync + 'static {
    // 文件系统操作
    fn read_file(&self, path: &Path) -> Result<FileContent, FileError>;
    fn write_file(&self, path: &Path, content: &str) -> Result<(), FileError>;
    fn file_info(&self, path: &Path) -> Result<FileInfo, FileError>;

    // Shell 操作
    fn execute_shell(&self, command: &str, options: ShellExecOptions) -> Result<ShellOutput, ExecutionError>;

    // 路径操作
    fn current_dir(&self) -> Result<PathBuf, ExecutionError>;
}
```

两个实现：

```rust
// 生产环境：真实操作系统
pub struct OsExecutionEnv {
    cwd: PathBuf,
}

// 测试环境：内存实现
pub struct InMemoryExecutionEnv {
    files: Arc<RwLock<HashMap<PathBuf, String>>>,
    cwd: PathBuf,
}
```

## 工具如何使用 ExecutionEnv

工具不直接操作环境，而是通过 `ExecutionToolContext` 持有 `ExecutionEnv`：

```rust
pub struct ExecutionToolContext {
    env: Arc<dyn ExecutionEnv>,
    mutation_queue: Arc<MutationQueue>,
}

// 创建工具时传入 context
pub fn create_read_tool(ctx: &ExecutionToolContext) -> Box<dyn AgentTool> {
    Box::new(ReadTool {
        env: ctx.env.clone(),
    })
}

// 工具实现
impl AgentTool for ReadTool {
    async fn execute(&self, params: ToolCallParams) -> AgentToolResult {
        let path = parse_path(&params.arguments)?;
        match self.env.read_file(&path) {
            Ok(content) => AgentToolResult::success(content.text),
            Err(e) => AgentToolResult::error(format!("Read failed: {}", e)),
        }
    }
}
```

## InMemoryExecutionEnv：测试利器

`InMemoryExecutionEnv` 用 `HashMap` 模拟文件系统：

```rust
pub struct InMemoryExecutionEnv {
    files: Arc<RwLock<HashMap<PathBuf, String>>>,
    cwd: PathBuf,
    shell_scripts: Arc<RwLock<HashMap<String, ShellScript>>>,
}

impl ExecutionEnv for InMemoryExecutionEnv {
    fn read_file(&self, path: &Path) -> Result<FileContent, FileError> {
        let files = self.files.read().unwrap();
        files.get(path)
            .map(|content| FileContent { text: content.clone() })
            .ok_or(FileError::not_found(path))
    }

    fn write_file(&self, path: &Path, content: &str) -> Result<(), FileError> {
        let mut files = self.files.write().unwrap();
        files.insert(path.to_path_buf(), content.to_string());
        Ok(())
    }

    fn execute_shell(&self, command: &str, _options: ShellExecOptions) -> Result<ShellOutput, ExecutionError> {
        let scripts = self.shell_scripts.read().unwrap();
        scripts.get(command)
            .map(|script| script.output.clone())
            .ok_or(ExecutionError::not_found(command))
    }
}
```

